  "notes": [
    "Complete list: 6 actions (src/actions.js) and 2 boolean feedbacks (src/feedbacks.js) for the System Management Controller of Disguise hardware.",
    "Protocol: HTTP requests with Basic authentication to the SMC management port (src/requests.js, src/index.js; the config fields are ip, username and password; supported firmware 4.3.7 per the config text). Reading state needs no credentials, sending commands needs a valid SMC user.",
    "The power_off action has an option entry of type static-text without an id (a note that the OS is not shut down gracefully); it carries no value and is not catalogued.",
    "The notification action sends two requests (duration, then the notification); the Priority and Duration number fields have required: true, the LED strip colour fields required: false. set_strip sends the red, green and blue values for every mode.",
    "Feedback state ids: power uses on/off, power_fault uses the strings true/false (the callback compares with state === \"true\").",
    "Built on @companion-module/base ~1.4.3: options do not support expressions."
  ]
